200 random worlds, every route enumerated (4 variables, 24 orders x 16 fillings):
 (a) max |E[w 1(x)] - R(x)| with weight R / prod q (order probabilities NOT divided out): 2.66e-15
 (b) max |E[w 1(order, x)] - R(x)| with weight R / (prod pi prod q): 8.88e-16
 (a) and (b) give the same law over fillings: max difference 2.78e-16
 (c) counting visits with weight R and no division: total variation to T up to 0.719
